<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Jul 14 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are:</p>
<p>copper up 2075, tin down 15, lead down 50, zinc up 300, aluminium down 1625, nickel down 288, aluminium alloy up 40</p>
